l":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Any version after #99504\n\n### System information\n\n CachyOS Linux #\\1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Tue, 27 May 2025 18:32:32 +0000 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 (nvidia; 570.153.02) - 11th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-11400H @ 2.70GHz (12 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\n#99504 claims to have added support for WAV metadata tags.\n\nHowever when trying to read a file with this metadata:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9939b2c0-8986-4f4b-8a3d-eee68c986cdd)\n\nIt shows up like this:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7408ef1e-98f4-4575-90b5-f2ee4311b90b)\n\nWhen it should look like this:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dc2c185e-28ec-49ff-97a8-f4e39dc5c679)\n\nFrom what I've read, this issue was reported during that PR's development, but I think no one bothered to check whether it was solved or not before merging.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Download a WAV file with metadata tags ([this one](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18042497/01.-.Title.Theme.Main.Menu.zip) works)\n2. Make an AudioStreamWAV out of it, then print `get_tags()`.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[audio-tag-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20640878/audio-tag-mrp.zip)\n\nThe file is set to not be imported and will be loaded through `load_from_file`.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https:/